  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRG Minority Rights Group 2025-2028 - Minority Rights Group 2025-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MRG Minority Rights Group 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Minority Rights Group (MRG) is a global international rights-based organisation, headquartered in London. MRG is a guiding global player as well as a champion and defender of the rights of minorities and indigenous peoples. They operate globally, regionally and at national/local level in some 50 countries. In total, MRG interacts with about 150 organizations that form part of their network. The purpose of MRG&apos;s activities is to operate in different ways and with different methods for the full respect of human rights, for discriminated groups and people; regardless of ethnic, religious or linguistic background.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Minority Rights Group International (MRG) &#xe4;r en global internationell r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserad organisation. MRG &#xe4;r en v&#xe4;gledande global akt&#xf6;r samt f&#xf6;rk&#xe4;mpe och f&#xf6;rsvarare av minoriteters samt urfolks r&#xe4;ttigheter. MRG &#xe4;r verksamma globalt, regionalt och p&#xe5; nationell niv&#xe5; i ett 50-tal l&#xe4;nder. Totalt samverkar MRG med ca 150 organisationer som utg&#xf6;r en del av deras n&#xe4;tverk. Syftet med MRGs verksamhet &#xe4;r att bidra till att skydda, fr&#xe4;mja och &#xf6;ka respekten f&#xf6;r de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna f&#xf6;r diskriminerade grupper och m&#xe4;nniskor; oavsett etnisk, religi&#xf6;s eller spr&#xe5;klig bakgrund.</narrative>
  </description>
